    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a [mandatory gate for Meridian deployments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), requiring a signed release manifest for all code moving into staging and production. This directive is framed as a [direct response to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically citing the unauthorized arrival of unsigned artifacts in the previous quarter. The implementation is [formally codified as a settled decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), with Fairweather [explicitly assuming ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of the process. The [scope of the requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) is strictly defined, emphasizing conservation and control over the deployment pipeline.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification for the gate shifts from systemic policy to a specific, reactive account of past failures." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Moves from authoritative decision-making to explanatory justification." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Alternates between formal, stock-phrase directives and short, punchy explanations." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
